# use — a crime in a master's workshop without leave
#
# The smith's anvil in the Test Forge is his: a blacksmith with a hammer in hand may not lawfully USE it
# until the smith has given the use of the workshop (ask_to_use_workshop). `inspect workshops` reads the
# gates directly (usable=, crime=), so the proof does not depend on which mind the seed's kit hands the
# thinking.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm blacksmithing --grant-item hammer --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Forge" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Anvil"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

expect-state workshops stations=Test_Anvil,Test_Forge_Hearth,Test_Workbench master=blacksmith authorized=no usable=none
quit
